<sbb-title level="2">Lists.</sbb-title>
<p>Lyne offers list styles that are applied to the native HTML lists. The font size is set with a text class such as <code>sbb-text-m</code>.</p>
<sbb-table-wrapper>
<table class="sbb-table sbb-table--striped">
    <thead><tr><th style="white-space: nowrap;">List</th><th style="white-space: nowrap;">CSS class</th><th style="white-space: nowrap;">Sass mixin</th><th>Usage</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Standard</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>list</code></td><td>On <code>ul</code> and <code>ol</code>, also nested. The colour is inherited.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Steps</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-step-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>step-list</code></td><td>Only on <code>ol</code>. Describes a sequence of steps.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Icon</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-icon-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>icon-list</code></td><td>Icon as bullet, <code>circle-tick-small</code> by default. Custom icon with <code>--sbb-icon-list-marker-icon</code>, icon colour with <code>--sbb-icon-list-marker-icon-color</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Description</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>description-list</code></td><td>On <code>dl</code> for label and description. The colour is inherited.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</sbb-table-wrapper>

<sbb-title level="3">Standard.</sbb-title>
<ul class="sbb-list sbb-text-m"><li>First item</li><li>Second item</li></ul>
<sbb-title level="3">Steps.</sbb-title>
<ol class="sbb-step-list sbb-text-m"><li>First step</li><li>Second step</li></ol>
<sbb-title level="3">Icon.</sbb-title>
<ul class="sbb-icon-list sbb-text-m"><li>Task created</li><li>Changes applied</li></ul>
<sbb-title level="3">Description.</sbb-title>
<dl class="sbb-list"><dt>Label:</dt><dd>Description of the label.</dd></dl>
